 qemu-server (9.2.14) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * hotplug: fix enabling the tablet and keyboard devices on running aarch64
     VMs. When disabling the tablet, also remove the keyboard to avoid device
     mismatches that caused subsequent live migrations to fail.
 
   * clone: release IPAM addresses reserved for a clone if cloning fails, so
     they do not remain allocated to a nonexistent VM.
 
   * tpm: account for storage allocating TPM volumes larger than 4 MiB. Report
